# The repo-root .gitignore's standard VS "build results" x64/ pattern
# blanket-matches this vendored MSVC static-lib output too (same footgun
# documented at length in opus_dnn/.gitignore). Un-ignore the final
# rade.lib explicitly; everything else CMake/MSBuild would generate here
# stays ignored.
!build/x64/
!build/x64/Release/
!build/x64/Release/rade.lib
!build/x64/Release/VERSION.txt
